                <li><b>Acela Business:</b> Ideal for travelers who want faster travel times with premium comfort.</li>
                <li><b>Acela First:</b> The ultimate experience for those seeking luxury, speed, and exclusive amenities.</li>
            </ul>
            <p>Overall, all types are direct and reliable, making the route convenient regardless of your choice. Duration differences are minimal between classes on the same service, so your choice depends mostly on comfort, amenities, and speed preferences.</p>
